      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "RIGHTS AGAINST MANUFACTURERS IN RESPECT OF GUARANTEES IN THE SUPPLY OF GOODS Consumer's right of redress against manufacturers"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "VIII",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "GUARANTEES IN RESPECT OF SUPPLY OF SERVICES Implied guarantee as to reasonable care and skill"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "53",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where services are supplied to a consumer, there shall be implied a guarantee that the services will be carried out with reasonable care and skill. Implied guarantee as to fitness for particular purpose"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "54",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where services are supplied to a consumer, there shall be implied a guarantee that the services, and any product resulting from the services, will be—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "reasonably fit for any particular purpose; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "of such nature and quality that it can reasonably be expected to achieve any particular result, that the consumer makes known to the supplier, before or at the time of the making of the contract for the supply of the services, as the particular purpose for which the services are required or the result that the consumer desires to achieve."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The implied guarantees referred to in subsection (1) shall not apply where the circumstances show that—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the consumer does not rely on the supplier's skill or judgment; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "it is unreasonable for the consumer to rely on the supplier's skill or judgment. Implied guarantee as to time of completion"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "55",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where services are supplied to a consumer, there shall be implied a guarantee that the services will be completed within a reasonable time where the time for the services to be carried out is not—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "determined by the contract;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "left to be determined in a manner agreed by the contract; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "left to be determined by the course of dealing between the parties. Implied guarantee as to price"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "56",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where services are supplied to a consumer, there shall be implied a guarantee that the consumer shall not be liable to pay to the supplier more than the reasonable price for the services where the price for the services is not—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "determined by the contract;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "left to be determined in a manner agreed by the contract; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "left to be determined by the course of dealing between the parties."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where there is a failure to comply with the implied guarantee under subsection (1), the consumer's only right of redress shall be to refuse to pay more than the reasonable price."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nothing in Part IX shall be taken to confer on the consumer any other right of redress."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section, what is a \"reasonable price\" shall be a question of fact depending on the circumstances of each particular case, and where the price has been fixed under any written law, the reasonable price shall be as may be specified under that written law."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "50",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Part gives a consumer a right of redress against a manufacturer of goods where—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods fail to comply with the implied guarantee as to acceptable quality under section 32;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods fail to comply with the implied guarantee as to correspondence with description under section 34 due to the failure of the goods to correspond with a material description applied to the goods by or on behalf of the manufacturer or with the express or implied consent of the manufacturer;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods fail to comply with the implied guarantee as to repairs and spare parts under section 37;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods fail, during the currency of the guarantee, to comply with any express guarantee given by the manufacturer that is binding on the manufacturer in accordance with section 38. Exceptions to right of redress against manufacturers"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_51",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "51",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_51__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_51__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding section 50, there shall be no right of redress against the manufacturer under this Act in respect of goods which fail to comply with the implied guarantee under section 32 or 34 where the failure is due to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_51__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_51",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "an act, default or omission of, or any representation made by, a person other than the manufacturer; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_51__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_51",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a cause independent of human control, occurring after the goods have left the control of the manufacturer. Options against manufacturers where goods do not comply with guarantees"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "52",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a consumer has a right of redress against the manufacturer under this Part in respect of the failure of any goods to comply with a guarantee under Part V, the consumer may obtain damages from the manufacturer—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1__para_a__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "for the reduction in the value of the goods resulting from the manufacturer's failure, namely—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the reduction below the price paid or payable by the consumer for the goods; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the reduction below the average retail price of the goods at the time of supply, whichever price is lower;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "for any loss or damage to the consumer resulting from the manufacturer's failure, other than loss or damage through a reduction in the value of the goods, which is proved to be a result or consequence of the failure."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the consumer is entitled by an express guarantee given by the manufacturer to require the manufacturer to remedy the failure by—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "repairing the goods; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "replacing the goods with goods of identical type, no action shall be commenced under paragraph (1)(a) unless the consumer has required the manufacturer to remedy the failure and the manufacturer has refused or neglected to remedy, or has not succeeded in remedying, the failure within a reasonable time."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_39",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "39",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Part gives a consumer a right of redress against a supplier of goods where the goods fail to comply with any of the implied guarantees under sections 31 to 37. Exception in respect of implied guarantee as to acceptable quality"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "40",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding section 39, there shall be no right of redress against the supplier of goods under this Act in respect of the failure of the goods to comply with the implied guarantee as to acceptable quality where—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the manufacturer makes a representation in respect of the goods otherwise than by a statement on any packaging or label; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods would have complied with the implied guarantee as to acceptable quality if that representation had not been made. Options against suppliers where goods do not comply with guarantees"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "41",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a consumer has a right of redress against the supplier under this Part in respect of the failure of any goods to comply with a guarantee under Part V, the consumer may exercise the following remedies:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the failure is one that can be remedied, the consumer may require the supplier to remedy the failure within a reasonable time in accordance with section 42; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the failure is one that cannot be remedied or is of a substantial character within the meaning of section 44, the consumer may— (i) subject to section 43, reject the goods in accordance with section 45; or (ii) obtain from the supplier damages in compensation for any reduction in the value of the goods below the price paid or payable by the consumer for the goods."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In addition to the remedies under subsection (1), the consumer may obtain from the supplier damages for any loss or damage suffered by the consumer, other than loss or damage through a reduction in the value of the goods, which is proved to be a result or consequence of the failure."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the supplier refuses or neglects to remedy the failure as required under paragraph (1)(a), or refuses or neglects to do so within a reasonable time, the consumer may—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "have the failure remedied elsewhere and obtain from the supplier all reasonable costs incurred in having the failure remedied; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "subject to section 43, reject the goods in accordance with section 45. Satisfaction of requirement to remedy a failure"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "42",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A supplier may satisfy a requirement under section 41 to remedy a failure of any goods to comply with a guarantee by—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the failure does not relate to title, repairing the goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the failure relates to title, curing any defect in title;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "replacing the goods with goods of identical type; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "providing a refund of any money paid or other consideration provided by the consumer in respect of the goods where the supplier cannot reasonably be expected to repair or replace the goods or cure any defect in title."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a consumer obtains goods to replace defective goods under paragraph (l)(c), the replacement goods shall, for the purposes of this Act, be deemed to be supplied by the supplier and the guarantees and obligations under this Act relating to the supply of goods to a consumer shall apply to the replacement goods,"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A refund under paragraph (1)(d) means a refund in cash of the money paid or the value of any other consideration provided, or both, as the case may require. Loss of right to reject goods"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "43",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The right conferred under this Act to reject goods shall not apply where—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the right is not exercised within a reasonable time;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods have been disposed of by the consumer;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods have been lost or destroyed while in the possession of a person other than the supplier;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods were damaged after delivery to the consumer for reasons not related to their state or condition at the time of supply; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods have been attached to or incorporated in any real or personal property and the goods cannot be detached or isolated without damaging them."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of paragraph (l)(a), \"reasonable time\" means a period from the time of the supply of the goods within which it would be reasonable to expect the defect to become apparent having regard to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the type of goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the use to which a consumer is likely to put the goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the length of time for which it is reasonable for the goods to be used; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the amount of use to which it is reasonable for the goods to be put before the defect becomes apparent. Failure of substantial character"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "44",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of paragraph 41(1)(b), a failure to comply with a guarantee shall be of a substantial character where—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods would not have been acquired by a reasonable consumer fully acquainted with the nature and extent of the failure;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods depart in one or more significant respects from the description by which they were supplied or, where they were supplied by reference to a sample or demonstration model, from the sample or demonstration model;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_c__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_c__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods are—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "substantially unfit for a purpose for which goods of the type in question are commonly supplied; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where subsection 33(1) applies, unfit for a particular purpose made known to the supplier or represented by the supplier to be a purpose for which the goods would be fit, and the goods cannot easily and within a reasonable time be remedied to make them fit for such purpose; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods are not of acceptable quality within the meaning of section 32 because they are unsafe. Manner of rejecting goods"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "45",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "( I) The consumer shall exercise the right conferred under this Act to reject goods by notifying the supplier of the decision to reject the goods and of the ground or grounds for the rejection."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the consumer exercises the right to reject goods, the consumer shall return the rejected goods to the supplier unless—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "because of— (i) the nature of the failure to comply with the guarantee in respect of which the consumer has the right to reject the goods; or ( i i) the size or height or method of attachment, the goods cannot be returned or removed or transported without significant cost to the consumer, in which case the supplier shall collect the goods at its own expense;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "because of the method of attachment, the goods cannot be returned or removed without significant damage to the real or personal property to which they are attached, in which case the supplier shall compensate the consumer for any loss or damage resulting from or consequent upon such removal; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods have already been returned to, or retrieved by, the supplier."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the ownership in the goods has passed to the consumer before the consumer exercises the right of rejection, the ownership in the goods re-vests in the supplier upon notification of rejection Consumer's option of refund or replacement"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "46",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "( 1) Where the consumer exercises the right to reject goods conferred under this Act, the consumer may choose to have—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a refund of any money paid or other consideration provided by the consumer in respect of the rejected goods; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "goods of the same type and of similar value to replace the rejected goods where such goods are reasonably available to the supplier as part of the stock of the supplier, and the supplier shall make provision accordingly."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A refund referred to in paragraph (1}(a) means a refund in cash of the money paid or the value of any other consideration provided, or both, as the case may require."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The obligation to refund cannot be satisfied by permitting the consumer to acquire other goods from the supplier."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a consumer obtains goods to replace rejected goods under paragraph (1)(b), the replacement goods shall, for the purposes of this Act, be deemed to be supplied by the supplier, and the guarantees and obligations under this Act relating to the supply of goods to a consumer shall apply to the replacement goods. Assessment of damages in case of hire-purchase agreements"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "47",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The damages that a consumer may recover for a failure of goods supplied under a hire-purchase agreement to comply with a guarantee under this Act shall be assessed, in the absence of evidence to the contrary, on the basis that the consumer will complete the purchase of the goods or would have completed the purchase if the goods had complied with the guarantee. Liability for representation"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "48",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where goods assigned or procured to be assigned to the supplier by a person acting in trade (the \"dealer\") are supplied to a consumer, every representation made to the consumer by the dealer or by any person acting on the dealer's behalf in connection with, or in the course of negotiations leading to, the supply of the goods shall give the consumer—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "as against the supplier, subject to section 49, the same rights as the consumer would have had under this Act if the representation had been made by the supplier personally; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "as against the dealer who made the representation and any person on whose behalf the dealer was acting in making it, the same rights against any or all of them personally as the consumer would have had under this Act if that person had supplied the goods to the consumer as a result of the negotiations."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Without prejudice to any other rights or remedies to which a supplier may be entitled, a supplier shall be entitled, where the representation was made without his express or implied authority, to be indemnified by the dealer who made the representation and by any person on whose behalf the dealer was acting in making it, against any damage suffered by the supplier through the operation of subsection (1). Liability of assignees and financiers"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "49",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__subsec_5"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This section shall apply only in respect of hire-purchase agreements."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The liability under this Act of an assignee of the rights of a supplier under a contract of supply shall not exceed the amount owing by the consumer under the contract at the date of the assignment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The liability under this Act of a financier who has lent money on the security of goods supplied to a consumer shall not exceed the amount owing by the consumer at the date of the loan."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the assignee referred to in subsection (2) or the financier referred to in subsection (3) suffers any losses because of a liability to the consumer under this Act, the assignee or financier shall, subject to any agreement with the supplier, be entitled to be indemnified by the supplier against those losses."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No assignment of the rights under a contract of supply shall affect the exercise of any right or remedy given under this Act against the supplier."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The implied guarantees under this Part shall apply whether or not the goods are supplied in connection with services. Implied guarantee as to title"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_6"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subject to subsection (5), the following guarantees shall be implied where goods are supplied to a consumer:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the supplier has a right to sell the goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the goods are free from any undisclosed security; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the consumer has a right to quiet possession of the goods, except in so far as that right is varied by—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a term of the agreement for supply where that agreement is a hire-purchase agreement within the meaning of the Hire-Purchase Act 1967 [Act 212];"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a disclosed security; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a term of the agreement for supply."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where subparagraphs (1)(c)(ii) and (iii) apply, the supplier shall first orally advise the consumer as to the way in which his right to quiet possession of the goods may be varied."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The advice given by the supplier under subsection (2) shall be as may be sufficient to enable a reasonable consumer to understand the general nature and effect of the variation."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a consumer has received oral advice under subsection (2)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the supplier shall give to the consumer a written copy of the security or agreement for supply or a written copy of the part thereof which provides for the variation as explained to the consumer under subsection (2); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the consumer shall acknowledge receipt thereof in writing."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the goods are only hired or leased—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "paragraphs (1)(a) and (b) shall not apply; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "paragraph (1)(c) shall confer a right to quiet possession of the goods only for the period of the hire or lease."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_6__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section— \"right to sell\" means a right to dispose of the ownership of the goods to the consumer at the time when that ownership is to pass; \"undisclosed security\" means any security that is—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "not disclosed to the consumer in writing before he agrees to the supply; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "not created by or with his express consent. Implied guarantee as to acceptable quality"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_6"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where goods are supplied to a consumer there shall be implied a guarantee that the goods are of acceptable quality."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of subsection (1), goods shall be deemed to be of acceptable quality—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_iii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_iv",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_v"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if they are— (i) fit for all the purposes for which goods of the type in question are commonly supplied; (ii) acceptable in appearance and finish;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "free from minor defects;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "safe; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_v",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "v",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "durable; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b__subpara_iii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b__subpara_iv",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b__subpara_v"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a reasonable consumer fully acquainted with the state and condition of the goods, including any hidden defects, would regard the goods as acceptable having regard to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the nature of the goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the price;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any statements made about the goods on any packaging or label on the goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any representation made about the goods by the supplier or the manufacturer; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b__subpara_v",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "v",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "all other relevant circumstances of the supply of the goods."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where any defects in the goods have been specifically drawn to the consumer's attention before he agrees to the supply, then, the goods shall not be deemed to have failed to comply with the implied guarantee as to acceptable quality by reason only of those defects."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where goods are displayed for sale or hire, the defects that are to be treated as having been specifically drawn to the consumer's attention for the purposes of subsection (3) shall be defects disclosed on a written notice displayed with the goods."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Goods shall not be deemed to have failed to comply with the implied guarantee as to acceptable quality if—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods have been used in a manner or to an extent which is inconsistent with the manner or extent of use that a reasonable consumer would expect to obtain from the goods; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the goods would have complied with the implied guarantee as to acceptable quality if they had not been used in that manner or to that extent."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A reference in subsections (3) and (4) to a defect is a reference to any failure of the goods to comply with the implied guarantee as to acceptable quality. Implied guarantee as to fitness for particular purpose"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "33",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subject to subsection (2), the following guarantees shall be implied where goods are supplied to a consumer:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the goods are reasonably fit for any particular purpose that the consumer makes known, expressly or by implication, to the supplier as the purpose for which the goods are being acquired by the consumer; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the goods are reasonably fit for any particular purpose for which the supplier represents that they are or will be fit."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The implied guarantees referred to in subsection (1) shall not apply where the circumstances show that—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the consumer does not rely on the supplier's skill or judgment; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "it is unreasonable for the consumer to rely on the supplier's skill or judgment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This section shall apply whether or not the purpose is a purpose as to which the goods are commonly supplied. Implied guarantee that goods comply with description"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_34",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "34",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_34__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_34__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_34__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_34__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_34",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where goods are supplied by description to a consumer, there shall be implied a guarantee that the good correspond with description."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_34__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_34",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A supply of goods is not prevented from being a supply by description by reason only that, being exposed for sale or hire, they are selected by a consumer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_34__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_34",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If the goods are supplied by reference to a sample or demonstration model as well as by description, the implied guarantees in this section and section 35 shall apply. Implied guarantee that goods comply with sample"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "35",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The following guarantees shall be implied where goods are supplied to a consumer by reference to a sample or demonstration model:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the goods correspond with the sample or demonstration model in quality; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the consumer will have a reasonable opportunity to compare the goods with the sample or demonstration model."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If the goods are supplied by reference to a description as well as by a sample or demonstration model, the implied guarantees in this section and section 34 shall apply. Implied guarantee as to price"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "36",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "( 1) Where goods are supplied to a consumer, there shall be implied a guarantee that the consumer shall not be liable to pay to the supplier more than the reasonable price of the goods where the price for the goods is not—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "determined by the contract;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "left to be determined in a manner agreed by the contract; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "left to be determined by the course of dealing between the parties."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where there is a failure to comply with the implied guarantee under subsection (1), the consumer's only right of redress shall be to refuse to pay more than the reasonable price."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nothing in Part VI shall be taken to confer on the consumer any other right of redress."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section, what is a \"reasonable price\" shall be a question of fact depending on the circumstances of each particular case, and where the price has been fixed under any written law, the reasonable price shall be as may be specified under that written law. Implied guarantee as to repairs and spare parts"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_37",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "37",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_37__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_37__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_37__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_37__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where imported or locally manufactured goods are supplied to a consumer, there shall be implied a guarantee that the manufacturer and the supplier will take reasonable action to ensure that facilities for the repair of the goods and the supply of spare parts for the goods are reasonably available for a reasonable period after the goods are so supplied."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_37__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection (1) shall not apply where reasonable action has been taken to notify the consumer, at or before the time the imported or locally manufactured goods are supplied, that the manufacturer or the supplier or both does not undertake that repair facilities and spare parts will be available for those goods."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_37__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where reasonable action has been taken to notify the consumer, at or before the time the goods are supplied, that the manufacturer or supplier or both does not undertake that repair facilities and spare parts will be available for those goods after the expiration of a specified period, subsection (1) shall not apply in relation to the imported or locally manufactured goods after the expiration of that period. Manufacturer's express guarantee"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "38",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An express guarantee given by a manufacturer of goods which are supplied to a consumer shall bind the manufacturer to the extent specified in subsections (2), (3) and (4)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An express guarantee in respect of goods given by a manufacturer in a document binds the manufacturer where the document is given to a consumer with the actual or apparent authority of the manufacturer in connection with the supply by a supplier of those goods to the consumer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An express guarantee which is included in a document relating to the goods and which appears to have been made by the manufacturer of the goods shall, in the absence of proof to the contrary, be presumed to have been made by the manufacturer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Proof that a consumer was given a document containing express guarantees by a manufacturer in respect of goods in connection with the supply of those goods to the consumer shall, in the absence of proof to the contrary, constitute proof that the document was given to the consumer with the authority of the manufacturer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section, \"express guarantee\", in relation to any goods, means an undertaking, assertion or representation in relation to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the quality, performance or characteristics of the goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the provision of services that are or may at any time be required in respect of the goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the supply of parts that are or may at any time be required for the goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the future availability of identical goods, or of goods constituting or forming part of a set of which the goods in relation to which the undertaking, assertion or representation is given or made form part of; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the return of money or other consideration should the goods not meet any undertaking by the guarantor, given or made in connection with the supply of the goods or in connection with the promotion by any means of the supply or use of the goods."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_X",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "X",
